      "id": "claim_b85a5bc07b574bee8e1c4bd18929c56e",
      "statement": "The subcommands dispatched in cmd/yolo/main.go: (no args) starts the TUI; -v/--version/version prints the version block; help/-h/--help prints usage; serve runs serveCmd (core server only, --addr default 127.0.0.1:4096); auth runs authCmd (list | add <provider> [key] | remove <provider>); profile runs profileCmd (list | add [name] [-d DESC] | use ID | edit ID [-n NAME] [-d DESC] | remove ID | copy SRC NAME [-d DESC]).",
