      "statement": "In TUI mode the in-process server binds 127.0.0.1:0 (ephemeral port) and a resume session id is validated up front (a missing session prints 'session not found: <id>' and exits 2); in serve mode SIGINT/SIGTERM triggers a graceful drain (in-flight turns cancelled, the listener shuts down within 5 s, a second signal force-kills) and the process exits 0.",
