    {
      "id": "claim_cce556c4ddad4218bea554fb0f879239",
      "statement": "Config is JSONC merged deterministically (innermost wins; instructions concatenates) with {env:NAME} substitution; global config is ~/.config/yolo/<profile_id>/yolo.jsonc (file precedence config.json -> yolo.json -> yolo.jsonc) and project config is yolo.jsonc/yolo.json in the working directory and each ancestor up to / plus <workDir>/.yolo/yolo.jsonc as the innermost override; global config is partitioned into profiles (one dir per profile under ~/.config/yolo/, active recorded in ~/.config/yolo/active, a first run creates default) with selection precedence --profile flag > YOLO_PROFILE env > active profile > default.",
