    {
      "id": "claim_01ba07a07356400cbe163d73be618210",
      "statement": "Key environment variables: YOLO_LLM=fake (+ YOLO_FAKE_SCRIPT=path.json) swaps the LLM drivers for a scripted fake (offline dev mode, one scripted turn per model request, delay_ms per turn); YOLO_PROFILE selects the config profile (beaten by the --profile flag); YOLO_LOG_LEVEL sets the logger level DEBUG/INFO/WARN/ERROR (invalid -> INFO); YOLO_PRINT_LOGS=1 mirrors the log to stderr; KIDO_API_KEY is the credential for the builtin kido provider (highest request-time precedence); KIDO_BASE_URL and E2E_TIMEOUT are live-e2e overrides (defaults https://ai.kido.ws/v1 and 180 s).",
