    {
      "id": "claim_219d144750124d24b9b00c1e94521b31",
      "statement": "The data directory: ~/.local/share/yolo/ holds auth.json (credentials), storage/yolo.db (sessions/messages/parts/permissions/todos SQLite), plans/ (plan-agent files writable by the engine without asking), and log/yolo.log (rotated at 5 MiB to yolo.log.1); ~/.cache/yolo/ holds models.json (cached Zen model catalog); global config lives in ~/.config/yolo/<profile_id>/yolo.jsonc with the active profile in ~/.config/yolo/active; XDG_CONFIG_HOME is honored and XDG_DATA_HOME/XDG_CACHE_HOME shift the data and cache roots.",
